# Dev-mode override: leave VITE_API_BASE_URL empty so the frontend makes
# same-origin requests (e.g. /api/v1/listings/home) that Vite's dev server
# proxy (see vite.config.ts) forwards to the real backend server-side —
# this avoids the browser CORS failures that happen when the app instead
# calls the backend directly cross-origin (as the base .env's absolute
# VITE_API_BASE_URL does, which is meant for production builds where there
# is no dev proxy).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
